    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d975">

                <pb facs="0744" n="628" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg628"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/14009a.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Special Agent Silliman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-12-13">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 13, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>We are much disappointed and distressed to learn that executions are taking
                    place. Please bring every possible influence to bear on <pb facs="0745" n="629"
                        xml:id="pg629"/> authorities in behalf of political prisoners. See if you
                    can secure permission for political prisoners to leave the country. Do
                    everything in your power to save Iturbide. He acted for Carbajal and turned the
                    city over to the Constitutionalists, thus saving much loss of life as well as
                    preventing disorder. It would be most unfortunate if he were dealt with
                    harshly.</p>
                <p>Impress upon the authorities the importance of cultivating the respect of foreign
                    nations, whose good opinion will be necessary in establishing proper
                    international relations.</p>
                <p>Be constant and continuous in your effort to protect from harm or insult the
                    representatives of religious orders. Inform us whether religious exercises are
                    interfered with and report any complaints which have been made to you by the
                    representatives of any church or religious organization.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
